    4. Ensure each sprite fits (height <= target bar height, x within cols 1..W-2, no x-overlap for co-targeted sprites)
    5. Build output: place color-swapped sprites bottom-aligned in their target bars
    6. Build input: erase sprites from bars, place original-color sprites in top area at same x-positions
